---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — Pendium"
  description="Start a Discovery Sprint or get in touch with Pendium about AI implementation for your company."
>
  <section class="contact-hero">
    <div class="container contact__inner">
      <div class="contact__content">
        <span class="label label--accent">Contact</span>
        <h1 class="mt-16">Let's get specific<br/>about your AI opportunity.</h1>
        <p class="mt-24">
          The best starting point is usually a Discovery Sprint — two weeks, fixed price,
          clear output. Tell us what you're working on and we'll take it from there.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-options mt-48">
          <div class="contact-option">
            <span class="label">Email</span>
            <a href="mailto:hello@pendium.co" class="contact-option__value mt-8">hello@pendium.co</a>
            <p class="mt-8">Best for initial introductions and project briefs. We respond within one business day.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-48">
          <span class="label">Tell us about your project</span>
          <form class="contact-form mt-24" name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" action="/contact/success">
            <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />

            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="name">Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name" />
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" />
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="company">Company</label>
              <input type="text" id="company" name="company" placeholder="Company name" />
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="interest">What are you looking for?</label>
              <select id="interest" name="interest">
                <option value="">Select one</option>
                <option value="discovery-sprint">Discovery Sprint</option>
                <option value="ai-assistants">AI Assistant Design & Deployment</option>
                <option value="knowledge-management">Knowledge Management System</option>
                <option value="automation">Design & Tech Automation</option>
                <option value="retainer">Embedded Retainer</option>
                <option value="unsure">Not sure yet</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="message">Tell us about the project</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="6" placeholder="What's the problem you're trying to solve? What does your current setup look like? What would success look like?"></textarea>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn--primary">Send →</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="contact__sidebar">
        <div class="sprint-card">
          <span class="label label--accent">Recommended starting point</span>
          <h3 class="mt-16">Discovery Sprint</h3>
          <p class="mt-12">Two weeks. A clear-eyed audit of your AI opportunity, a prioritized roadmap, and a plan you can act on. Fixed price. No ongoing commitment required.</p>
          <div class="sprint-card__price mt-24">
            <span class="sprint-card__price-value">$8,000–$15,000</span>
            <span class="sprint-card__price-label">Fixed price · 2 weeks</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="sprint-card__includes mt-24">
            <li>Current-state audit</li>
            <li>AI opportunity mapping</li>
            <li>Prioritized recommendations</li>
            <li>Implementation roadmap</li>
            <li>1 hour readout call</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="sidebar-note">
          <span class="label">Capacity</span>
          <p class="mt-12">Pendium takes on a limited number of engagements at a time to maintain quality. If you're planning ahead, reach out early.</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-hero {
    padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 80px);
    padding-bottom: 96px;
  }

  .contact__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 360px;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .contact__content > p {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .contact-options {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .contact-option {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .contact-option__value {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent-1);
    transition: opacity 0.15s;
  }

  .contact-option__value:hover { opacity: 0.7; }

  .contact-option p {
    font-size: 13px;
    max-width: none;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  /* ── Form ── */
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .form-field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .form-field label {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .form-field input,
  .form-field select,
  .form-field textarea {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .form-field input:focus,
  .form-field select:focus,
  .form-field textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .form-field input::placeholder,
  .form-field textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .form-field select option {
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }

  /* ── Sidebar ── */
  .contact__sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 32px);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .sprint-card {
    padding: 36px;
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-2);
    background: var(--bg-card);
  }

  .sprint-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .sprint-card p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .sprint-card__price {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .sprint-card__price-value {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .sprint-card__price-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .sprint-card__includes {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .sprint-card__includes li {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .sprint-card__includes li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent-1);
  }

  .sidebar-note {
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .sidebar-note p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .contact__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .contact__sidebar {
      position: static;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .sprint-card {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .contact__sidebar {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
